WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:02.068
I know no contracts have been signed

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:03.870
with the enterprises.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.971
The directors have told me,

00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.040
so why are you fooling around

00:00:08.641 --> 00:00:09.376
it will be ready

00:00:09.376 --> 00:00:12.045
during this quarter

00:00:12.645 --> 00:00:14.080
based on the funds available

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:14.814
under the budget.

00:00:16.983 --> 00:00:17.984
I want all of this

00:00:17.984 --> 00:00:20.253
to be done within a month.

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:22.489
What quarter are you talking about?

00:00:22.489 --> 00:00:24.391
Do you not understand the circumstances

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.291
we are in?

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.794
Please complete this work within a month.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.965
Agreed?

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:33.833
We will try to do our best.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:37.337
No. Do not try to do your best.

00:00:37.337 --> 00:00:39.139
Please get it done in a month.

00:00:39.139 --> 00:00:40.573
No later.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.308
I think what it's really designed to do,

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:45.011
honestly, is to deflect himself

00:00:45.011 --> 00:00:46.546
from any criticism

00:00:46.546 --> 00:00:48.681
for the handling of this war

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:49.549
a lot of the issues

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:51.017
that have kind of plagued

00:00:51.017 --> 00:00:52.385
the Russian military.

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.687
They're a product of the incompetence

00:00:54.687 --> 00:00:55.789
and corruption

00:00:55.789 --> 00:00:57.323
that have really flourished under

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.892
Vladimir Putin's leadership.

